# Homepage scope and stack

This repo is HTML + Tailwind (Vite). Do not introduce WordPress, React, or another stack unless the user asks for it.

**Live now:** Home (`index.html`), About (`about.html`), Services hub (`services.html`), Bellbottom Pier Drilling (`services/bellbottom-pier-drilling.html`), Straight-Shaft Drilling (`services/straight-shaft-drilling.html`), Contact (`contact.html`), and Careers (`careers.html`), plus same-page jumps and the phone number. `services/pier-drilling.html` refreshes to the Bellbottom page.

**Stay “coming soon”** until the user says otherwise:

- Detail pages for Pool Pier Drilling, Commercial & Residential Pier Drilling, and Concrete Pour Assistance (hub cards and Explore links stay on the services hub; nav and footer link to those hub sections)
- Projects

Keep those items visible in the menu. Do not build remaining inner pages or invent their layouts.

